承認這是選集\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、三個跨訪談的共同點\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、為什麼神單不能當目錄\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、和海龜、都鐸、塞柯塔怎麼互相指\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"《金融怪傑》把很多公開訪談收成書，後來變成「頂級交易員怎麼說」的主要來源之一。讀者最容易拿走某一筆傳奇描述；比較能帶走的是跨訪談重複出現的三件事：先講風險、有寫得下來的規則、以及承認自己的性格限制。本站已有一篇四共同點，這篇專講「怎麼讀這套書才不會讀成漫畫」。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"選集已被過濾，留下的是願意被訪問且故事好講的人\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"風格可以相反，風險與規則卻反覆出現\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"讀成漫畫就會去找神單，讀成問卷才會檢查自己\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、先承認這是選集\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"書不是普查。沒被寫進去的人更多，失敗的人通常沒有同等篇幅。把選集當成功公式，是倖存者偏差。能用的讀法是：這些人願意承認的限制是什麼，而不是他們多準。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"選集已被過濾\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"失敗樣本不在書裡\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"限制比神單有用\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三個跨訪談的共同點\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一，幾乎都先能講自己單筆最多輸多少。第二，都有某種「什麼情況我不做」的清單。第三，都承認某種類型的市場或性格自己做不好。第三點最常被讀者跳過，因為它不刺激。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"讀者想找的\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"訪談比較常給的\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"你該做成\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"進場密技\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"風險上限\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"自己的上限\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"個性傳奇\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"不做清單\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"自己的不做\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"保證風格\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"承認短板\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"自己的短板\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"可複製報酬\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"不可複製條件\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"只複製檢查\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、為什麼神單不能當目錄\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"神單沒有你的成本、你的胃納、你的睡眠。訪談裡的數字條件一旦被拿來當目錄，你就在讀漫畫。本站人物文的共同契約也是這句：只留結構。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"看到具體進出就當故事\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"看到上限與不做就當作業\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"作業寫進自己的紙\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!當普查!抄神單!忽略沒被寫進書的人\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"讀壞\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、和海龜、都鐸、塞柯塔怎麼互相指\"}],[\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"這些名字在選集或同一傳統裡反覆出現。互相指不是為了堆權威，是為了讓你看到：不同嘴巴在講同一組無聊的事。無聊通常比較真。\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"重複出現的較值得抄作業\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"只出現一次的傳奇當娛樂\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"無聊的句子優先\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"讀任何一章，只准抄三行到自己的紙：上限、不做、短板。想抄進場條件，先問條件在你的市場還在不在。\"}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"為什麼每個人方法都不一樣？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"因為性格與市場不同。共同的是風險與不做清單，不是進場。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"我該模仿誰？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"不該模仿誰。該寫自己的三行。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"新的怪傑書還要讀嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"當問卷讀可以。當尋寶圖讀，愈新愈容易被故事帶走。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和頂級交易員四共同點重複嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"那篇列習慣；這篇教你怎麼讀這套書。可互為目錄。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"金融怪傑是過濾過的訪談。能留的是上限、不做清單與短板，不是神單。讀成問卷，不要讀成漫畫。\"}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-頂級交易員四共同\",{\"href\":\"/learn/lessons-from-top-traders\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"頂級交易員四共同點\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-都鐸瓊斯\",{\"href\":\"/learn/tudor-jones-risk-first-interviews\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"都鐸瓊斯\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-海龜實驗\",{\"href\":\"/learn/turtle-traders-experiment-what-it-really-taught\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"海龜實驗\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\"